<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-Z GROUP NETS PLN 1.2 MLN IN OCT.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-Z GROUP NETS PLN 1.2 MLN IN OCT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Group net profit	     1.20 vs  na</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 2.01 vs  na</p>
<p> Group sales		   30.57 vs  na</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Group net profit	     8.79 vs  na</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	12.07 vs  na</p>
<p> Group sales		  231.24 vs  na</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Zabrze SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
